[:db/add "b21ef304-13e2-5bd3-a315-af96c244518f" :answer-field/choices "a1a2e6fd-1b28-5ce3-b075-ac25c3adf8f1"] [:db/add "b21ef304-13e2-5bd3-a315-af96c244518f" :answer-field/choices "0de49c50-0e56-57fd-bdf6-72b7fce9208d"] [:db/add "b21ef304-13e2-5bd3-a315-af96c244518f" :answer-field/choices "79e7cf58-1773-5a15-975b-fcd0b3795882"] [:db/add "b21ef304-13e2-5bd3-a315-af96c244518f" :answer-field/choices "17bd18f2-7a56-5226-9ed2-d139c6c5e60c"] [:db/add "b21ef304-13e2-5bd3-a315-af96c244518f" :answer-field/choices "82367070-48bc-5435-81bb-c7520d817485"] [:db/add "b21ef304-13e2-5bd3-a315-af96c244518f" :answer-field/correct "0de49c50-0e56-57fd-bdf6-72b7fce9208d"] [:db/ensure "b21ef304-13e2-5bd3-a315-af96c244518f" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "d222cce5-96b3-53b1-84ca-5d6ee64c9788" :question/id #uuid "d222cce5-96b3-53b1-84ca-5d6ee64c9788"] [:db/add "d222cce5-96b3-53b1-84ca-5d6ee64c9788" :question/problem "Consider the system of linear equations\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}2x-2y-4z &=4 \\\\ -x+y &=4 \\\\ 2x-6z &=6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nUse the standard method of Gaussian elimination to reduce the augmented matrix to row echelon form, and then solve the linear system. Select the solution $(x,y,z)$."] [:db/add "d222cce5-96b3-53b1-84ca-5d6ee64c9788" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix is\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}2 & -2 & -4 & 4 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -6 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nNormalize the first pivot with $R_1:=\\frac{1}{2}R_1$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -6 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n$R_2:=R_2+(1)R_1$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 6 \\\\ 2 & 0 & -6 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\n$R_3:=R_3+(-2)R_1$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 6 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -2 & 2\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe second pivot is zero, while the third row has a nonzero second entry. Exchange $R_2$ and $R_3$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 2 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nNormalize with $R_2:=\\frac{1}{2}R_2$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2 & 6\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nNormalize with $R_3:=-\\frac{1}{2}R_3$.\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThus the row echelon matrix is\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -1 & -2 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -3\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nBack substitute, starting with the last row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z &=-3 \\\\ y &=1-(-1)(-3) \\\\ &=-2 \\\\ x &=2-(-1)(-2) \\\\ &\\quad -(-2)(-3) \\\\ &=-6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe solution $(x,y,z)$ is\n\n$$\n\\left(-6,-2,-3\\right)\n$$\n\n"] [:db/add "d222cce5-96b3-53b1-84ca-5d6ee64c9788" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "d222cce5-96b3-53b1-84ca-5d6ee64c9788" :question/answer-fields "b21ef304-13e2-5bd3-a315-af96c244518f"] [:db/ensure "d222cce5-96b3-53b1-84ca-5d6ee64c9788" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186096673 :knowledge-point/questions "d222cce5-96b3-53b1-84ca-5d6ee64c9788"] [:db/add "8e23b8be-d393-5d5a-9339-d5c3fbc43943" :answer/id #uuid "8e23b8be-d393-5d5a-9339-d5c3fbc43943"] [:db/add "8e23b8be-d393-5d5a-9339-d5c3fbc43943" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "8e23b8be-d393-5d5a-9339-d5c3fbc43943" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -4\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "8e23b8be-d393-5d5a-9339-d5c3fbc43943" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c1bc4435-7bd6-5b3a-b1ec-6eb652b4f2d3" :answer/id #uuid "c1bc4435-7bd6-5b3a-b1ec-6eb652b4f2d3"] [:db/add "c1bc4435-7bd6-5b3a-b1ec-6eb652b4f2d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "c1bc4435-7bd6-5b3a-b1ec-6eb652b4f2d3" :answer/value "\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -3 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1 & -4\\end{array}\\right]"] [:db/ensure "c1bc4435-7bd6-5b3a-b1ec-